  "description": "Magnolia Calligraphy is an elegant script font that blends the charm of classic decorative copperplate calligraphy with a modern, slightly bold touch. Designed with meticulous detail, this font exudes stylish sophistication, making it perfect for projects that require a touch of luxury and elegance.\nThis slightly bold typeface is clean, feminine, sensual, and easy to read, enhanced by a variety of beautiful letter connections and stylistic alternatives. This font is versatile and ideal for a variety of formal and creative applications such as wedding invitations, branding, restaurant menus, logos, fashion, beauty packaging, greeting cards, stationery, book covers, magazines, and advertising materials.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Magnolia Calligraphy is an elegant script font that blends the charm of classic decorative copperplate calligraphy with a modern, slightly bold touch. Designed with meticulous detail, this font exudes stylish sophistication, making it perfect for projects that require a touch of luxury and elegance.</p>\n<p>This slightly bold typeface is clean, feminine, sensual, and easy to read, enhanced by a variety of beautiful letter connections and stylistic alternatives. This font is versatile and ideal for a variety of formal and creative applications such as wedding invitations, branding, restaurant menus, logos, fashion, beauty packaging, greeting cards, stationery, book covers, magazines, and advertising materials.</p>",
